⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of The Fifth House
node ARN · ARN · ⟦The Fifth House:ARN:1d1492⟧

WHO   — The Fifth House — the destroyed past · the revenge
WHAT  — The buried wound that drives everything: the House whose ruin made Kuthuman's ascension and made Garth a wanderer with one eye and one purpose.
WHERE — ARN · Arena  Framework inputs: Arena (Forstchen, 1994)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the gunslinger always rides in for a reason older than the town — the fifth House is the fire Garth has come to answer.
HOW   — By its absence — a destroyed House remembered only by the stranger it left, and the planeswalker it raised up.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I was the House they burned to make a god — and the only thing that survived me was a one-eyed boy who never forgot, and came back to collect.

